@startuml
title DFD Level 0 — Промежуточное состояние
left to right direction

!theme plain

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor LightGray
    BorderColor Black
    FontSize 12
    BorderColor Gray
}
skinparam entity {
    BackgroundColor Black
    BorderColor Black
    FontSize 11
}

' Внешние сущности 
rectangle "CRM FinUnion" as CRM_FU
rectangle "CRM RetailBank" as CRM_RB
rectangle "Core Banking FinUnion" as CORE_FU
rectangle "Core Banking RetailBank" as CORE_RB
rectangle "Card Processing FinUnion" as CARD_FU
rectangle "Card Processing RetailBank" as CARD_RB
rectangle "Loan System FinUnion" as LOAN_FU
rectangle "Loan System RetailBank" as LOAN_RB

rectangle "MDM Customer Hub" as MDM
rectangle "Integration Layer" as INT
rectangle "DWH" as DWH
rectangle "BI" as BI
rectangle "DataHub / Каталог данных" as DATAHUB
rectangle "Регуляторная отчётность" as REG_REPORT

' Связи и потоки данных с действиями
CRM_FU --> INT : CRUD Client (онбординг)
CRM_RB --> INT : CRUD Client (онбординг)
CORE_FU --> INT : CRUD Account, Transaction
CORE_RB --> INT : CRUD Account, Transaction
CARD_FU --> INT : CRUD Card, Transactions
CARD_RB --> INT : CRUD Card, Transactions
LOAN_FU --> INT : CRUD Loan, Status
LOAN_RB --> INT : CRUD Loan, Status

INT --> MDM : Enrich & Validate Client (dedup, global_id)
MDM --> INT : Return global_client_id, resolved identities

INT --> CORE_FU : Sync enriched client IDs (Update)
INT --> CORE_RB : Sync enriched client IDs (Update)

INT --> DWH : Load raw + enriched data (Create/Aggregate)
DWH --> BI : Provide aggregated data (Read)
DWH --> REG_REPORT : Export for regulatory reporting (Extract)
DWH --> DATAHUB : Publish metadata, lineage, SLA (Enrich)
DATAHUB --> INT : Provide reference data, schemas (Read)
DATAHUB --> DWH : Provide business glossary, tags (Read)

note right of INT
  Integration Layer:
  - маршрутизация
  - дедупликация по MDM
  - обогащение
  - CDC/ETL
  - контроль качества
end note

note left of MDM
  MDM Customer Hub:
  - глобальные ID клиентов
  - правила маппинга
  - разрешение дублей
end note

note bottom of DWH
  DWH:
  - сырые и очищенные витрины
  - агрегации
  - история изменений
  - подготовка для BI и регуляторики
end note
@enduml